                           </content>
                           <content styleCode="bold">].</content> </paragraph>
                     </text>
                     <effectiveTime value="20230728"/>
                  </section>
               
<section xmlns="urn:hl7-org:v3" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" ID="_255A26DF-7CCC-662A-2E94-C1B7E4850977">
                     <id root="5aef12ee-f91e-7f0c-e713-3a2daa7e3ade"/>
                     <code code="42229-5" displayName="SPL UNCLASSIFIED SECTION" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1"/>
                     <title>
                        <content styleCode="bold">7.3 Serotonergic Drugs </content>
                     </title>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>[See <content styleCode="bold">Dosage and Administration </content>(<content styleCode="bold">
                              <linkHtml href="#_e9cf54f6-0e56-2e4e-0132-ba396ec3bcc9">2.9</linkHtml>
                           </content>, <content styleCode="bold">
                              <linkHtml href="#_99b1c252-2e4d-299f-cfa7-49fba6268724">2.10</linkHtml>
                           </content>)<content styleCode="bold">, Contraindications </content>
